              style: TextStyle(
                fontSize: 11,
                color: Colors.grey.shade600,
              ),
            ),
          ],
        ),
      ),
    );
  }

  void _showInfoDialog(
    String title,
    String content,
  ) {
    showDialog(
      context: context,
      builder: (context) => AlertDialog(
        title: Text(title),
        content: Text(content),
        actions: [
          TextButton(
            onPressed: () =>
                Navigator.pop(context),
            child: const Text('OK'),
          ),
        ],
      ),
    );
  }
}

